      ],
      "source": "https://info.newstandard-group.com/blog/bonhomme"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The 1858 Yankton Sioux Treaty orchestrated one of the largest land transfers in Dakota Territory history, shaping the development of Bon Homme.",
